{
  "schema": "vgdd.domain-pack.v1",
  "id": "research-report",
  "title": "調査報告書（非開発の例。このパックで実際に仕事を回したことはない）",
  "work_item": {
    "id": { "prefix": "R-", "digits": [3, 4] },
    "store": "reports/items",
    "spec_sections": ["問い", "受け入れ条件"],
    "resource_field": "sections_allowed"
  },
  "artifact": { "kind": "document-set", "integrate": "publish-copy" },
  "lifecycle": [
    { "stage": "問いの設定", "produces": "調査の問いと範囲（オーナーが承認）", "gate": "approval", "status": "implemented" },
    { "stage": "資料の収集", "produces": "出典の一覧", "gate": "none", "status": "not_implemented" },
    { "stage": "起草", "produces": "報告書の草稿", "gate": "none", "status": "not_implemented" },
    { "stage": "審査", "produces": "出典と主張の対応の審査", "gate": "judicial", "status": "implemented" },
    { "stage": "公開", "produces": "報告書の公開（オーナーの承認）", "gate": "approval", "status": "implemented" }
  ],
  "audits": [
    { "id": "source-url-format", "command": ["node", "tools/check-source-urls.mjs", "--strict"], "required": true, "sandbox": true },
    { "id": "length", "command": ["node", "tools/check-length.mjs", "--max-chars", "20000"], "required": false, "sandbox": true }
  ],
  "judiciary": {
    "categories": ["requirement", "correctness", "citation", "overclaim"],
    "min_judges": 1,
    "distinct_lineage": true,
    "inputs": ["document_diff", "acceptance", "audit_results", "source_excerpts"]
  },
  "protected": ["vgdd/**", "vgdd/next/domains/**", "tools/**"],
  "disclosures": [
    "このパックで実際に仕事を回したことはない。非開発領域への汎用化の形を示す例である",
    "audits の command（tools/check-source-urls.mjs・tools/check-length.mjs）は実在しない例である",
    "出典の URL の形式を検査しても、出典が主張を支えていることは保証しない。その確認は司法（LLM）に頼り、決定論的ではない",
    "資料の収集・起草の段は Kernel に関門がない（not_implemented）。関門の数に数えない"
  ]
}
